      en: ["Area of northern highlands is about 30,000 km².", "Highest peak reaches approximately 1,500 m.", "Over 1,000 plant species are found in the region.", "Annual precipitation ranges from 400 to 1,000 mm.", "Cork oak forests cover approximately 800 km².", "Ichkeul National Park is a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve."],
